<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; AI NOTE: PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex, independently reconciled. thams cad owns the first each and every; each one of them is a supplied resumption and stays unpaired. lo re re is omitted because yearly recurrence is distributed in the seasonal frame, with no separately defensible year exponent. dus tshigs owns the HGM-attested four seasons as a compound; no independent numeral is inferred. zhag re rer / day by day is a full distributive phrase and yang separately licenses even. nyams owns get worse, excluding supplied starts to; 'bri owns the English iterative decrease less and less. 'phel ba / more and min pa / never retain separate sound lexical links. Supplied participants, what others have, ever manage to find, auxiliaries, and seasonal/monthly framing remain unpaired. No uncertain mapping is nulled. These are provisional corpus correspondences, not human-approved definitions.</div>
